        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Platform Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Malicdtower is a pixel style 2D shooting adventure game with a mild soul level difficulty experience, manually generated maps, and dozens of weapons. Players will delve into and search for the girl who controls time and space, cross intricate castles, climb the sky path of clouds, and overcome overwhelming enemies and obstacles<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980820/extras/8f44d90c6163cfd5d2178ec05ae80cc5.poster.avif?t=1761913243\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980820/extras/8f44d90c6163cfd5d2178ec05ae80cc5.webm?t=1761913243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980820/extras/8f44d90c6163cfd5d2178ec05ae80cc5.mp4?t=1761913243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >diverse weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can freely choose their favorite skills and weapon styles to enjoy the adventure, with echo waves that penetrate everything, dazzling golden flashes, strange trajectory particle balls, and cool flying opponents~<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980820/extras/4614031ee69bf30d95ddbd8b08b6c079.poster.avif?t=1761913243\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980820/extras/4614031ee69bf30d95ddbd8b08b6c079.webm?t=1761913243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980820/extras/4614031ee69bf30d95ddbd8b08b6c079.mp4?t=1761913243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >role cultivate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive continuously from the corroded mechanical remains of the dungeon, selecting diverse weapons each time to complete different tactical challenges. Players will destroy and conquer all enemies, and there are many special rooms in the game. Defeat the enemies in these rooms one by one, absorb experience, and complete skill upgrades!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Platform Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Malicdtower is a pixel style 2D shooting adventure game with a mild soul level difficulty experience, manually generated maps, and dozens of weapons. Players will delve into and search for the girl who controls time and space, cross intricate castles, climb the sky path of clouds, and overcome overwhelming enemies and obstacles<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980820/extras/8f44d90c6163cfd5d2178ec05ae80cc5.poster.avif?t=1761913243\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980820/extras/8f44d90c6163cfd5d2178ec05ae80cc5.webm?t=1761913243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980820/extras/8f44d90c6163cfd5d2178ec05ae80cc5.mp4?t=1761913243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >diverse weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can freely choose their favorite skills and weapon styles to enjoy the adventure, with echo waves that penetrate everything, dazzling golden flashes, strange trajectory particle balls, and cool flying opponents~<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980820/extras/4614031ee69bf30d95ddbd8b08b6c079.poster.avif?t=1761913243\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980820/extras/4614031ee69bf30d95ddbd8b08b6c079.webm?t=1761913243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980820/extras/4614031ee69bf30d95ddbd8b08b6c079.mp4?t=1761913243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >role cultivate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive continuously from the corroded mechanical remains of the dungeon, selecting diverse weapons each time to complete different tactical challenges. Players will destroy and conquer all enemies, and there are many special rooms in the game. Defeat the enemies in these rooms one by one, absorb experience, and complete skill upgrades!</p>",
        "short_description": "Immersed in this unknown continent, you will explore with a mysterious girl in battle, resist and break through the encirclement of hostile creatures, in order to survive and ultimately win. Upgrade! Combining skills, facing the surprise attacks of various monsters and intelligent weapon armies",
